OL,3,AReform up against 'complainants'
OL,4,Asociety', Farage tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarage said he expects it "won't be too
OL,7,Flong" before he is interviewed as part
OL,8,Fof the ongoing parliamentary
OL,9,Finvestigation into whether he should
OL,10,Fhave publicly declared the sum upon his
OL,11,Felection as an MP.
